        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>明朝的统治 - 思维导图</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", sans-serif;\n    background: #fdfdf7;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .intro {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    padding-right: 40px;\n  }\n  .faded-note {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    width: 120px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #bbb;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .side-label {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -18px;\n    top: 90px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #999;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n  }\n  .diagram-box {\n    border: 1.5px solid #444;\n    padding: 15px 20px 25px 40px;\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 480px;\n  }\n  .box-label {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #666;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 6px;\n    left: 8px;\n  }\n  .tree {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .root {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    border: 1px solid #222;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    margin-top: 120px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    height: fit-content;\n  }\n  .branches {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    margin-left: 25px;\n    border-left: 2px solid #333;\n    padding-left: 15px;\n  }\n  .branch {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .branch::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -15px;\n    top: 12px;\n    width: 15px;\n    border-top: 2px solid #333;\n  }\n  .branch-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    padding-top: 4px;\n    margin-right: 10px;\n  }\n  .sub-branches {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    border-left: 1.5px solid #555;\n    padding-left: 12px;\n  }\n  .sub-branch {\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .sub-branch::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -12px;\n    top: 8px;\n    width: 12px;\n    border-top: 1.5px solid #555;\n  }\n  .sub-branch-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    display: inline;\n  }\n  .leaf-lines {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .leaf-lines div {\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .indent-group {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    border-left: 1px solid #777;\n    padding-left: 8px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .stamp {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 260px;\n    right: 30px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    border: none;\n    transform: rotate(-3deg);\n  }\n  .stamp .flower {\n    font-size: 20px;\n  }\n  .stamp .name {\n    border: 1px solid #c0392b;\n    padding: 1px 4px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .stamp .sub {\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .design-note {\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .lower-tree {\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #aaa;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"intro\">\n    学完了本课，请你以自己擅长的形式，为本课所学知识画一幅示意图，揭示知识间的联系。可以是思维导图，也可以是结构图、漫画等。请写出你的设计意图，让老师看得懂。\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faded-note\">[illegible]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"diagram-box\">\n    <div class=\"box-label\">绘图区</div>\n    <div class=\"side-label\">绘图区</div>\n\n    <div class=\"tree\">\n      <div class=\"root\">明朝<br>的统治</div>\n\n      <div class=\"branches\">\n\n        <!-- 建立 -->\n        <div class=\"branch\">\n          <div class=\"branch-title\">建立</div>\n          <div class=\"leaf-lines\">\n            <div>时间：1368年</div>\n            <div>建立者：朱元璋</div>\n            <div>都城：应天府（南京）</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 强化皇权 -->\n        <div class=\"branch\">\n          <div class=\"branch-title\">强化<br>皇权</div>\n          <div class=\"sub-branches\">\n            <div class=\"sub-branch\">\n              <span class=\"sub-branch-title\">改革</span>\n              <div class=\"indent-group\">\n                <div>地方：设立\"三司\"，分散行省的权力，</div>\n                <div>分封诸子为王，驻守各地，监控地方</div>\n                <div>中央：废除丞相制度和中书省，设</div>\n                <div>立五军都督府。</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-branch\">\n              <div>设锦衣卫：为监视官员，后设立东厂，这两</div>\n              <div>个机构合称为\"厂卫\"，由皇帝直接指挥</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-branch\">\n              <div>立\"祖制\"规定子孙不得改变他的做法</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 科举考试 -->\n        <div class=\"branch\">\n          <div class=\"branch-title\">科举<br>考试</div>\n          <div class=\"sub-branches\">\n            <div class=\"sub-branch\">范围：《四书》《五经》</div>\n            <div class=\"sub-branch\">标准：朱熹的《四书集注》</div>\n            <div class=\"sub-branch\">格式：八股文</div>\n            <div class=\"sub-branch\">影响：禁锢思想，成为皇帝旨意的顺从者</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stamp\">\n      <div class=\"flower\">🌺</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">LEI蕾</div>\n      <div class=\"sub\">from 小红书</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"design-note\">设计意图说明：</div>\n\n  <div class=\"lower-tree\">\n    <div class=\"branches\" style=\"margin-left:0; border-left:none; padding-left:0;\">\n      <div class=\"branch\">\n        <div class=\"branch-title\">经济</div>\n        <div class=\"sub-branches\">\n          <div class=\"sub-branch\">农业：引进玉米、甘薯、马铃薯、花生、向日葵等。</div>\n          <div class=\"sub-branch\">手工业：棉纺织业、丝织业（苏州）、制瓷业(景德镇)</div>\n          <div class=\"sub-branch\">\n            <span class=\"sub-branch-title\">商业</span>\n            <div class=\"indent-group\">\n              <div>城市：北京、南京等</div>\n              <div>商帮：晋商、徽商</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
